# DESK42 -- the Read/Write . Read-Only pair of ADFFINFO, which is the part of
# the rebuilt tree that needed a writer behind it (`dos_chmod`, deskinf.c:591-
# 605).  C:\README.TXT is switched to Read-Only and the box is asked again.
#
#   C_FILEINFO   the box, Read/Write selected (attr 0x20 on the card)
#   D_RONLY      Read-Only clicked -- the AES has moved the radio selection
#   E_AFTEROK    after OK: `dos_chmod` ran, `changed` is true, `do_info`
#                returned -1 and `fun_rebld_marked` rebuilt the window
#   G_AGAIN      the box a second time -- now Read-Only is the selected one
#   H_END        Cancel taken
#
# Coordinates: probe run, plus the d42b [dlg] dump (root (160,121) 320x256;
# FFRWRITE -> click (248,305), FFRONLY -> (396,305), FFOK -> (216,353),
# FFCNCL -> (424,353)).
